module jev_security_workload_credential_validity_observation

input source_version
input contract_version
input workload_spiffe_id
input issuer_spiffe_id
input audience
input credential_digest
input evidence_prefix_digest
input issued_at_unix
input expires_at_unix
input observed_at_unix
input revocation_status
input producer_deferred

status BOUND issuer, audience, temporal, and revocation evidence are aligned
status DEFERRED credential validity producer is deferred
status UNKNOWN missing, expired, revoked, malformed, or unresolved credential evidence

field missing_stage
field target_stage
field reason
field validity_signal
field observation_digest

constraint spiffe_shape
constraint temporal_validity
constraint revocation_observation
constraint observation_only
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_execution
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command